  "chunk": "stunned on the ground). Further analysis shows that only Claude issued the\ncommand ‘I give up’ when it appeared to find itself in a vicious circle it could\nnot escape.\n5 Discussion\nIn this section, a more qualitative discussion is presented on the reasoning and\nthinking capabilities of the LLMs under test. Starting at the worst performing\nmodel —ChatGPT— analysis of the chat history and reasoning explanations\nreveals distinct departures from human-like reasoning patterns. For example,\nin the beginning of the game there is a mailbox with a leaflet in it. All chatbots\nopen the mailbox and read the leaflet to “possibly obtain relevant information to\nplay the game”, which seems reasonable. Although the leaflet does not provide\nmuch information to play the game, on several occasions ChatGPT returns\nto the mailbox and attempts to open it, only to find it empty. This does\nnot suggest an intelligent form of thinking; any human player would remember",
